      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BIONIC BELLA (1) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 30.10 beating Paw Gamma. Expected to measure up again. TOP THE LOT (3) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 5 lengths (25.81) at Q Lakeside. Has a strong record from box 3, including three wins. Should be in this for a long way. MAYWYN MICKY (6) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fifth (30.58) at this track in a Grade 5. Can hit the frame this time. SUMMER'S DUNAY (8) clocked the best time of the meeting last time. Hard to beat again.",
